{collatz\n} will output the collatz seqence starting at n

n => n/2,  if n even
n => 3n+1, if n odd

continue until n=1

Collatz Conjecture: Every collatz sequence end with a one.

Ie can it ever diverge, or end in a loop not containing 1?


